{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09230","headline":"酬张协律 · 韦应物","name":"酬张协律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔人鬻舂地，今人复一贤。\n属余藩守日，方君卧病年。\n丽思阻文宴，芳踪阙宾筵。\n经时岂不怀，欲往事屡牵。\n公府适烦倦，开缄莹新篇。\n非将握中宝，何以比其妍。\n感兹栖寓词，想复痾瘵缠。\n空宇风霜交，幽居情思绵。\n当以贫非病，孰云白未玄。\n邑中有其人，憔倅即我愆。\n由来牧守重，英俊得荐延。\n匪人等鸿毛，斯道何由宣。\n遭时无早晚，蕴器俟良缘。\n观文心未衰，勿药疾当痊。\n晨期简牍罢，驰慰子忡然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}